"role.tanukiInterviewer.name" : "Interviewer"
"role.tanukiInterviewer.short" : "Interview"
"role.tanukiInterviewer.blurb" : "Bring their testimony to the meeting."
"role.tanukiInterviewer.generalBlurb" : "Bring their testimony to the meeting."
"role.tanukiInterviewer.doc" : "A Crewmate role.<br>Record your own voice and the voices of living players in your sight for the configured duration.<br>Press the voice recorder button at the upper left of the meeting to play the recording to everyone.<br>Recording again overwrites the previous recording."
"role.tanukiInterviewer.tips" : "・Your microphone is included. Other voices are recorded only while visible to you.<br>・Players behind walls, outside your vision, invisible players and ghosts are excluded.<br>・A meeting or your death ends recording and saves the recorded portion.<br>・Only a living interviewer can start meeting playback. Everyone can hear it. Replay again after it finishes if uses remain; the allowance resets each meeting.<br>・Keep the latest recording across meetings. Recording again, game end or role removal discards it.<br>・The optional communications restriction blocks recording and saves an interrupted recording. Meeting playback is unaffected.<br>・Microphone mute is respected. Requires compatible TanukiBCL: desktop 3.2.36, Web/Mobile 3.28, or .NET 3.2.36-net-beta.1 or later."
"options.role.tanukiInterviewer.detail" : "Record yourself and nearby visible players, then play the recording to everyone in a meeting."
"options.role.tanukiInterviewer.seconds" : "Recording duration"
"options.role.tanukiInterviewer.cooldown" : "Recording cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiInterviewer.playbackLimit" : "Playbacks per meeting"
"options.role.tanukiInterviewer.disableInComms" : "Disable ability during communications sabotage"
"button.label.tanukiInterviewer.record" : "Record"
"button.label.tanukiInterviewer.recording" : "Recording"
"button.label.tanukiInterviewer.comms" : "Comms down"
"role.tanukiInterviewer.play" : "Play recording"
"role.tanukiInterviewer.playing" : "Playing"
"role.tanukiInterviewer.empty" : "No recording"
"role.tanukiInterviewer.exhausted" : "No plays left"
